{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>ABOUT STEAL DEAL</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into the world of <strong>Steal Deal</strong>, a fast-paced 2D shooting adventure where danger and opportunity collide at every turn. Whether you dive in solo or team up with a friend online, every run is a brand-new challenge thanks to procedurally generated levels that keep the action fresh and unpredictable.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2941450/extras/cff62b8c8cbf54394675fe5ddee756a4.poster.avif?t=1760461835\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2941450/extras/cff62b8c8cbf54394675fe5ddee756a4.webm?t=1760461835\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2941450/extras/cff62b8c8cbf54394675fe5ddee756a4.mp4?t=1760461835\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With <strong>five distinct worlds</strong> to conquer \u2013\u00a0 from the polluted streets of New SteelWorks to the icy terrains of a colossal glacier, every level cranks up the intensity with new dangers, tougher enemies, and nonstop action.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>IN THIS GAME YOU CAN:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face relentless waves of enemies that grow tougher the deeper you go</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect and upgrade an arsenal of powerful abilities and enhancements</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Master diverse combat scenarios where quick thinking can mean the difference between victory and defeat</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock new paths, discover many crazy weapons, and chase the legendary reward: <strong>the Divine Deal</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2941450/extras/50235b321e3a6ef2d09d37ec8197b0a1.poster.avif?t=1760461835\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2941450/extras/50235b321e3a6ef2d09d37ec8197b0a1.webm?t=1760461835\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2941450/extras/50235b321e3a6ef2d09d37ec8197b0a1.mp4?t=1760461835\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>ONLINE MULTIPLAYER:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Don\u2019t want to go in alone? Join forces with friends in online co-op and double the firepower. Coordinate your tactics, cover each other\u2019s backs, and compete to see who can grab the best loot!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><i>Are you ready to put everything on the line, fight your way through five unforgiving worlds, and seize the <strong>Divine Deal</strong>?</i></h2>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2941450?t=1760461835","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2941450/0950e97e9b28790ef13ab9a87ee1e1b08730f11d/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1760461835","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2941450/9ea250b68d8b56f2b5e7e65f9a7ab700be575b44/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1760461835","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2941450/9ea250b68d8b56f2b5e7e65f9a7ab700be575b44/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1760461835","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","demos":[{"appid":4003760,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>ABOUT STEAL DEAL</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into the world of <strong>Steal Deal</strong>, a fast-paced 2D shooting adventure where danger and opportunity collide at every turn. Whether you dive in solo or team up with a friend online, every run is a brand-new challenge thanks to procedurally generated levels that keep the action fresh and unpredictable.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2941450/extras/cff62b8c8cbf54394675fe5ddee756a4.poster.avif?t=1760461835\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2941450/extras/cff62b8c8cbf54394675fe5ddee756a4.webm?t=1760461835\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2941450/extras/cff62b8c8cbf54394675fe5ddee756a4.mp4?t=1760461835\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With <strong>five distinct worlds</strong> to conquer \u2013\u00a0 from the polluted streets of New SteelWorks to the icy terrains of a colossal glacier, every level cranks up the intensity with new dangers, tougher enemies, and nonstop action.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>IN THIS GAME YOU CAN:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face relentless waves of enemies that grow tougher the deeper you go</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect and upgrade an arsenal of powerful abilities and enhancements</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Master diverse combat scenarios where quick thinking can mean the difference between victory and defeat</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock new paths, discover many crazy weapons, and chase the legendary reward: <strong>the Divine Deal</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2941450/extras/50235b321e3a6ef2d09d37ec8197b0a1.poster.avif?t=1760461835\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2941450/extras/50235b321e3a6ef2d09d37ec8197b0a1.webm?t=1760461835\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2941450/extras/50235b321e3a6ef2d09d37ec8197b0a1.mp4?t=1760461835\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>ONLINE MULTIPLAYER:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Don\u2019t want to go in alone? Join forces with friends in online co-op and double the firepower. Coordinate your tactics, cover each other\u2019s backs, and compete to see who can grab the best loot!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><i>Are you ready to put everything on the line, fight your way through five unforgiving worlds, and seize the <strong>Divine Deal</strong>?</i></h2>","developers":["Barrel Head"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2941450/header.jpg?t=1760461835","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2941450/621600466/b2ea36dc09d374e86763bb48bed81929fedca9e0/1760460900/dash_av1.mpd?t=1760461834","dash_h264":"https://video